  "vibe": "The one chart-paper ground here: aged cream (#f0ead8) under met-blue isobars (#2e5fb3), with warning orange (#e8641f) reserved for the low. Space Mono sets the display — a monospace title face — against Familjen Grotesk body copy, so it reads like a station log rather than a poster. The backdrop is a live synoptic chart: four pressure contours undulate across the full width at falling opacity, labelled 1016 and 1012 in mono; a warm front sweeps left to right at 60px/s with three solid pips riding its arc; two ink wind barbs rock on their staffs; blue wind ticks scroll downward; and an orange dashed circle marked L rotates over the low. Montage tiles have zero tilt and stats carry hairline rules. It owns a METAR terminal, a barometer gauge, a station board and drop-in alerts.",
